<title>USA: Property Capital has gain on property sale.</title>
<headline>Property Capital has gain on property sale.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property Capital Trust said on Thursday it had taken a gain of $800,000 on the sale of its Canyon View II apartment project in San Ramon, Calif.</p>
<p>Property Capital said its share of the proceeds was $2.4 million.</p>
</text>
